meanings
  source-authoring-grammar
    defined-by relation
    definition "Finite source-description forms bind an entire authoring operation and its destination to a generated declaration in the same language grammar."
    precondition "Every byte of the request is consumed by one registered full form; destination, identifier, exact technical type and every string or integer operand bind the complete supported declaration; identifiers and numeric domains are valid; explicit quoted literal ownership is handled before this contract."
    effect "Produces conditional source spans and a declaration correspondence. Additional read-first, no-write, registration, deployment or future-work clauses do not match a source-only form and retain their independent authority. No import initialization, caller effects or compilation result is certified."
    source "js/agentic/code_task.mjs sha256=43fec02955a3e87b358ca6d6a4e7b03d4e59b45f72c6e6d092abc5b399940a67"
    source "rust/src/agentic_coding/code_task.rs sha256=f2dac4f34ccf0a1ecbbe68816b2499b2c0da6de89956746df5c1990f9eef1360"
    unit "request offsets are UTF16 in JavaScript and UTF8 in Rust"
    example "A renamed public zero-argument i64 function or a named f64 division function can match a whole source-authoring form."
    source "js/agentic/code_task/source_contract/declaration.mjs sha256=0be2df9d06b98942750879a3b6c143e6f1e317f18a2772c9581d9f48dc7f5475"
    source "rust/src/agentic_coding/code_task/source_contract/declaration.rs sha256=237d9e4361f69f10e0d6f2daa5f04abca0eb3c062a739d78d0c064ffd057700d"
    source "js/agentic/code_task/source_contract/matcher.mjs sha256=629841bc4ffad1520e42b1fb6a07fd0daf9727c13308b32f31990753cf1a3c1e"
    source "rust/src/agentic_coding/code_task/source_contract/matcher.rs sha256=56966a7b9d44fc9a752ea7d7a1eb366c2ced735f1db2fc1c0a185fd478df826a"
    source "data/seed/source-authoring-grammar.lino sha256=4aa5f2e25eee49be10117b96ddae4e90c16bfb21a71774107a0d240b1c48ac78"
    lexeme en
      words "source authoring grammar"
    lexeme ru
      words "грамматика создания исходного кода"
    lexeme hi
      words "स्रोत लेखन व्याकरण"
    lexeme zh
