    lexeme es
      words "gramática de creación de código fuente"
  float-division
    defined-by relation
    definition "One public Rust function takes one f64 parameter and returns that same parameter divided by an explicitly requested decimal f64 literal."
    precondition "The source declaration returns f64, its division operand is its declared parameter, and the denominator parses as finite and nonzero. The complete source-description form binds the requested name, destination, parameter type and denominator exactly."
    effect "Permits a reversible source draft through the existing target-preimage and literal-ownership guards; physical write/read receipts and native compilation remain separate obligations."
    unit "IEEE754 binary64 operand and denominator"
    example "A requested divisor changes the generated expression only when the source and request contracts agree."
    lexeme en
      words "floating point division"
    lexeme ru
      words "деление чисел с плавающей точкой"
    lexeme hi
      words "फ्लोटिंग पॉइंट विभाजन"
    lexeme zh
      words "浮点除法"
    lexeme es
      words "división de punto flotante"
  source-registration-composition
    defined-by relation
    definition "A registered finite form composes a fully source-qualified declaration operation with an explicit module registration action and its separately owned destination."
    precondition "The entire request must be consumed; the declaration has an existing valid identifier, numeric and exact technical-token contract; the registration destination is a different safe relative Rust path and the derived source basename is a valid Rust module identifier. All independent immutable requirements remain bound before effects."
    effect "Returns a conditional two-operation span graph. A recognized prefix retains its unconsumed remainder and blocks writes. A complete graph may use the existing observed source-write, source-readback, registration-preimage, registration-write and registration-readback transaction; import initialization, tool effects and compilation remain separate unknowns."
    unit "JavaScript UTF16 spans and Rust UTF8 spans reference the complete original request; composition whitespace is ASCII."
    example "A renamed integer declaration or finite nonzero f64 division can be registered through a compatible seeded connective; a deployment or unknown future-work tail is retained and refuses premature delivery."
    source "js/agentic/code_task/source_contract/registration_contract.mjs sha256=f6d32c67a6825a5dd043d00c4565f41b5600e7b5bcb97a36a508aad973495e63"
    source "rust/src/agentic_coding/code_task/source_contract/registration_contract.rs sha256=3de194f1a65543cd4193bdef60a355e5b7b091b72f7a8d2732ed8c4328942880"
    source "data/seed/source-authoring-grammar.lino sha256=4aa5f2e25eee49be10117b96ddae4e90c16bfb21a71774107a0d240b1c48ac78"
    lexeme en
      words "source and module registration composition"
    lexeme ru
      words "составление исходного кода и регистрации модуля"
    lexeme hi
      words "स्रोत और मॉड्यूल पंजीकरण संयोजन"
    lexeme zh
      words "源码与模块注册组合"
    lexeme es
      words "composición de fuente y registro de módulo"
  coding-source-authoring-contract-missing
    defined-by code
    role coding-source-authoring-contract-missing
    definition "A source-owned gap diagnosis when a recognized authoring request lacks a complete binding from all requested work to supported source and integration operations."
    precondition "Explicit edit and quoted literal ownership routes are considered first. The recognized semantic Rust declaration or registration request does not establish a complete supported source-description or composition contract for every required operation."
    effect "Renders the seed-owned localized final answer with Gap disposition and source-description-goal-coverage-unbound origin. It does not certify source writing, registration, compilation or deployment, and cannot be delivered as a grounded Finding. Independent operations retain their own effect and verification obligations."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "Missing source authoring contract: complete request remains unbound."
    source "js/agentic/code_task.mjs sha256=43fec02955a3e87b358ca6d6a4e7b03d4e59b45f72c6e6d092abc5b399940a67 handler=plan_verified_generated_source_step/planVerifiedGeneratedSourceStep"
